# The Worker secrets the deploy task uploads, by name. The deploy writes them to
# a temporary JSON file for `wrangler deploy --secrets-file` (a .env file would
# cut a value at "#" or expand "$"), and the value comes from the process
# environment, which cuenv fills from 1Password
# (op://sa.rawkode.academy/website-cache-invalidation, the same token the
# website checks). This file holds no secret values.
CACHE_INVALIDATION_TOKEN
